    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Why does the author mention X? / What is the",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 818
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "purpose of paragraph 2?",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 819
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 820
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Purpose / function：某句话、例子或段落在文章",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 821
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "中的作用。",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 822
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “不要只解释X是什么，要问：作者拿X来证明/说明前面的什",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 823
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "么？”",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 824
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 例子不是独立存在，它通常服务于观点、解释、对比或引入。",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 825
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 826
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先定位被问到的X。",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 827
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 读X前面1-2句，找作者刚提出的观点。",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 828
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 再读X后面一句，看作者如何收束。",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 829
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 把选项改写成“作者提X是为了___”，选能解释上下文结构的。",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 830
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 831
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 832
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 833
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· for example / for instance → 多半是举例支持前面概括",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 834
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 故事开头 → 可能用于引出主题",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 835
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 数据 → 常用于提供证据/显示规模",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 836
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 反例 → 用于挑战前面观点",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 837
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 你能说清“X服务于哪一个观点/结构功能”。",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 838
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 如果选项只是复述X内容，却没解释“为什么作者放它在这里”，通常不是功",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 839
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "能答案。",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 840
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 841
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "前句：Small design changes can strongly influence behavior. 后面举楼梯旁脚印图案让更多人走楼",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 842
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "梯。目的：illustrate how design can change behavior。",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 843
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 844
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把“例子内容”当“例子作用”。",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 845
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把作者目的扩大成整篇文章目的。",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 846
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 847
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 这个例子支持哪一句？",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 848
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 删掉例子后，前后逻辑少了什么？",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 849
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 850
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 851
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 852
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 例子作用 = 它在帮作者说明什么。",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 853
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 855
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. Why does the author mention an experiment? 第一问？",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 856
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 例子本身有趣，能直接选“to entertain”吗？",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 857
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 作者引用数据常用于？",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 858
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 目的题定位范围通常？",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 859
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. “mention X”正确答案通常是X本身内容还是作用？",
      "sourcePage": 31,
      "sourceIndex": 860
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 实验在支持前后的哪个观点。；2. 不能，看它服务的论点。；3. support/illustrate a claim, show",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 861
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "scale/trend。；4. 例子所在句+前后观点句。；5. 作用。",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 862
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R5 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R5”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 32,
      "sourceIndex": 863
    }
  ],
